// R2784000: the signature animation of every Stinkyscape, from stinkyscape-001 to stinkyscape-090 (with the tokens listed among them) card (docs/polish/9-card-animations.md).
// One line per catalog card, tokens included, in catalog order, its name in a comment after it
// (tables.test.ts holds the file to the catalog). An entry is one of:
//   "none: <reason>"                        the card's event rows alone ("none: pending" until its set's pass);
//   { bespoke: "<recipe>" }                 its own recipe (fx/cards/bespoke.ts), drawn in fx/cards/<set>/;
//   { setPiece: "<key>" }                   a board clear's set piece (fx/setPieces.ts), held for one beat (R2800000);
//   { <hook>: { motif, palette?, row? } }   a shared motif (fx/motifs/names.ts) on a hook.
//   { aura: { look, palette?, scope } }     a standing look while it holds, alone or beside hooks (fx/aura/looks.ts, R2787000).
// Hooks: `cast` (a non-Unit's play) and `cry` (a Unit's) play as the card resolves; `death`, `trigger` (a
// start- or end-of-turn hook or a Whenever) and `activate` play from the hook's `hookResolving` marker, a
// Trap's `cast` from its `trapFired` (R2797000). `palette` is a flavor's look (the card's own flavor by
// default); `row` is "replace" (the default: the motif draws the numbers in place of the event's own
// recipe) or "keep" (it plays over that recipe). R2797000 is this half's pass (issue #2797).
// stinkyscape-1.test.ts holds it to the measure.
{
  "stinkyscape-001": { cast: { motif: "hex" } }, // Freeze Ray
  "stinkyscape-002": { cast: { motif: "hex", palette: "Spirit" } }, // Absolute Zero
  "stinkyscape-003": { cast: { motif: "nova" } }, // Meteor
